          {
            "title": "Question: and operator",
            "id": 80470,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale operatore usiamo quando vogliamo eseguire il codice solo quando tutte le condizioni sono <code>True</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>and</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>or</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>not</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>and</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Richiedi un biglietto e l'iscrizione per un premio, ma <code>has_ticket or is_member</code> lo assegna con la sola iscrizione.</p><p>Quale modifica fa sì che la condizione richieda entrambi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sostituisci <code>or</code> con <code>and</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Scambia <code>has_ticket</code> e <code>is_member</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Usa solo <code>is_member</code> come condizione.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sostituisci <code>or</code> con <code>and</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: As many as we want",
            "id": 80487,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inizia verificando se <code>like_author</code> è <code>True</code>, poi usa <code>or</code> per verificare <code>like_genre</code> e infine <code>got_recommendation</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"and\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>like_author</code>, seguito da <code>or</code> e poi <code>like_genre</code>, <code>or</code>, <code>got_recommendation</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Compra il libro quando un motivo qualsiasi è vero, con qualsiasi valore delle tre variabili, così questa esecuzione stampa <code>Buy book</code>.</p><p>Verifica <code>like_author</code>, poi <code>like_genre</code> e infine <code>got_recommendation</code>, in quest'ordine.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"and\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"not\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>like_author</code>, seguito da <code>or</code>, <code>like_genre</code>, <code>or</code> e infine <code>got_recommendation</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
