            "id": 80483,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quante condizioni alternative sono collegate in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tre</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uno</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non ci sono condizioni alternative, tutte devono essere <code>True</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Tre.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Supponi che <code>got_recommendation</code> diventi <code>False</code>. Che cosa farebbe il codice modificato?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Visualizzerebbe comunque <code>Buy book</code> perché <code>like_genre</code> è <code>True</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non visualizzerebbe nulla perché una condizione è <code>False</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non visualizzerebbe nulla perché la prima condizione è <code>False</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Visualizzerebbe comunque <code>Buy book</code> perché <code>like_genre</code> è <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>"
